            "review_title": "Review at Om Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Marc K\n5 contributions\n0\nWorst Service of Any Restaurant\nAug 2024 • Couples\nThe service maybe the worst of any restaurant I have ever been to. My girlfriend and I have eaten there every week for at least six months. There is a new manager and the last three weeks the orders either aren't put in or put in correctly. Tonight it took us over an hour to get part of our dinner. A group from England came before us and when we left they only had half the dinner. It is a shame because the food is very good. I hope they get a better manager who knows what he is doing.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBring a book and download a movie because it will take a least an hour to get your meal.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten August 15, 2024",
